1039 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (When you place a dimension on the Rows or Columns shelves, headers for the members of that dimension are created. When you place a measure on the Rows or Columns shelf, quantitative axes for that measure are created. As you add more fields to the view, additional headers and axes are included in the table and you get an increasingly detailed picture of your data.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [9]
>>
